{"lyrics":"[00:00.86]Yeah-yeah\n[00:06.56]I like to do what I wanna do, I like to play with these bands\n[00:08.86]I got the money and fame now, my family don't understand, understand (Wheezy Outta Here)\n[00:13.38]Shit getting realer and realer, uh, came up on a couple of million, uh\n[00:16.74]I invest that in some buildings (I did), uh, look at my money, it tripled, uh (Triple)\n[00:19.84]Shit getting realer and realer (Shit gettin' real), uh, I lost my bro to the system, uh (I did)\n[00:24.42]I lost my bro to a pistol, uh, they tried to take me with him, uh (Lost my bro)\n[00:26.50]I can't go for that, no-no, I stay with killers every day (I can't go)\n[00:29.58]Keep a 40, it's hungry, I turn your block to a buffet (Yeah)\n[00:32.84]Yeah, I spend a lot, Balenciaga jacket, Dior shades (Yeah, ayy)\n[00:36.16]I got a lean stain on it, I'ma give it to my maid\n[00:39.50]Uh, people love to talk about the money that they make\n[00:42.74]Nobody wanna talk about the money that they save\n[00:45.84]Who am I to talk about it? I blow money every day\n[00:49.04]'Cause I know when you die, you can't take the shit to your grave\n[00:52.34]Gucci and Louis shoes everywhere, I don't got no closet space\n[00:55.46]Versace drawers, my underwear cost what you make in a week\n[00:58.96]Uh, big shit, expensive shit, all that shit\n[01:01.62].12 gauge, hit him, he do backflips, .40 hit him and he Michael Jackson\n[01:05.40]Uh, big shit, expensive shit, all that shit\n[01:08.58]Only wanna fuck one time, baby, I'm on the fall back shit\n[01:12.20]Matter fact, you wanna fuck her, but you on the call back list\n[01:14.94]But if I hit it already, chances are I ain't finna call back, bitch\n[01:18.26]Shit getting realer and realer, uh, came up on a couple of million, uh\n[01:21.54]I invest that in some buildings, uh, look at my money, it tripled, uh\n[01:24.72]Shit getting realer and realer, uh, I lost my bro to the system, uh\n[01:27.98]I lost my bro to a pistol, uh, they tried to take me 